{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《愛回家之三代同糖》重新召集林淑敏入劇組！下星期一將會以全新總裁角色「戴嘉婷」霸氣登場，卻瞬間捲入一宗外賣員推 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《愛回家之三代同糖》重新召集林淑敏入劇組！下星期一將會以全新總裁角色「戴嘉婷」霸氣登場，卻瞬間捲入一宗外賣員推跌阿婆引發全網抵制公關危機。新一集「戴小姐」被偷拍在地鐵欺壓基層員工，影片在網上瘋傳，令整個飲食集團陷入公關危機，令她決定親身上陣「拆彈」對抗外界質疑！\n</p>\n<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578735847427016_14608464326b098a5f0a752.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"20691cbd-5042-491a-a588-93c6b2871e76 (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578735847427016_14608464326b098a5f0a752.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有網民在將軍澳拍到林淑敏拍攝《三代同堂》（圖片來源：小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578736099212886_13871454456b098a616c973.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"remove-the-翡翠台-tvb.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578736099212886_13871454456b098a616c973.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>全新口頭禪！「我最鍾意畀人質疑」、「我，就係戴嘉婷」（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>《三代同糖》戴小姐爆發公關災難</h2>\n<p>將於11月30日（星期一）播出第79集劇情提及某飲食集團推出限時送餐保證，旗下外賣員卻在行人電梯推跌阿婆，瞬間引爆網民強烈抵制。集團總裁「戴嘉婷」（林淑敏飾演）更被拍到在地鐵車廂內欺壓外賣員，令原本已經升溫輿論徹底失控。面對這場史無前例公關災難，戴嘉婷決定尋求跨世代公關公司協助拆彈，試圖挽回企業聲譽。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578736251574923_214697176b098a62e5f37.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"remove-all-logo-overlays.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578736251574923_214697176b098a62e5f37.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>戴小姐紮起長髮身體力行送外賣！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17957873639815689_5629554756b098a645e1cd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"remove-all-logo-overlays (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17957873639815689_5629554756b098a645e1cd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>預告中身份好神秘！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>林淑敏捨棄經典造型化身幹練女強人</h2>\n<p>喺最新預告片入面，林淑敏徹底告別過去維持10年的「龍力蓮」波浪捲髮與浮誇墊肩花裙，改以一頭俐落大側分無劉海直長髮配搭深色西裝套裝示人，展現出截然不同幹練女強人氣場。</p>\n<h2>戴小姐霸氣不服輸！劇透全新對白口頭禪 </h2>\n<p>雖然外表煥然一新，但她依然保留了觀眾最熟悉的霸氣神態，觀眾在最新劇集預告見到戴小姐霸氣十足說出對白「我最鍾意畀人質疑」然後身體力行親自送外賣，然後遇到楊帆時自我介紹「我，就係戴嘉婷」，紛紛表示期待，成功為觀眾帶來一種既熟悉又陌生新鮮感，宛如平行宇宙入面另一位霸氣女高層！</p>\n<h2>總裁戴嘉婷親自送外賣反擊剝削基層指控</h2>\n<p>面對公關公司質疑限時送餐變相剝削員工，戴嘉婷選擇以最直接方式作出反擊，霸氣拋出一句「我最鍾意畀人質疑」後，便換上制服親自落區送外賣。她不但公開解僱外賣員背後真正內情，更親自拍片還原地鐵風波全部真相，力證自己並非網上流傳般冷血無情。正當大眾以為事件即將平息之際，劇中另一角色楊光卻意外發現有人拍下關鍵影片，揭出地鐵風波截然不同另一面真相。</p>\n<h2>將軍澳成名街外景拍攝掀起網民熱烈討論</h2>\n<p>早前有網民在將軍澳成名街偶遇林淑敏聯同林芷羿及候雋熙為劇集拍攝外景，目擊者興奮拍下短短幾秒片段上載至社交平台，隨即引爆大批劇迷熱烈討論。不少網民看到全新造型後感到非常震撼，紛紛留言表示「霸氣返晒嚟」，更有粉絲直指以後要改口叫「戴小姐」，絕對不能再嗌錯做大小姐。大批觀眾在各大討論區發文表示對於這個充滿反差感新角色充滿期待，並持續關注地鐵風波最終走向。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578736591089835_21268918076b098a66533c5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578736591089835_21268918076b098a66533c5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578736716063332_2352864096b098a679a921.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578736716063332_2352864096b098a679a921.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>戴小姐接受《慌張西望》採訪！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578736854194787_155986686b098a68e11c5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578736854194787_155986686b098a68e11c5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578736978582397_6196264716b098a6a8b93a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179578736978582397_6196264716b098a6a8b93a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>目前的官方劇情未有提及許家傑旳角色，未來一星期所見他的角色似乎尚未登場！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%84%9b%e5%9b%9e%e5%ae%b6%e4%b9%8b%e4%b8%89%e4%bb%a3%e5%90%8c%e7%b3%96/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">愛回家之三代同糖</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%88%b4%e5%98%89%e5%a9%b7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">戴嘉婷</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9e%97%e6%b7%91%e6%95%8f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">林淑敏</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3551269\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 27 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T15:03:58.459108+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1521,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T13:49:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:37:30.102625+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T14:57:33.839834+00:00","content_hash":"cea25a4c6b44ff0d840551fa477e99b785f9e20c3feedd50d385b5f7f4ce2742","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}